    "intro_html":  "If you have ever stood in a line on a New York sidewalk at midnight, you know this plate: turmeric yellow rice, chopped marinated chicken, a pile of lettuce and tomato, and that white sauce that people have written entire internet arguments about. It is three components, all of which hold in the fridge for the better part of a week, which is why it might be the best meal prep dish ever invented by accident. Each container carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{cal}} calories and {{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
